    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey into the fantasy world of Epica, compete with other players from around the world for rank one on the ladder.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fantasy adventure &amp; exploration game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting &amp; trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global rankings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam achievements </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">State of Epica</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is accessible during Early Access, the core development stage. The game went through several major updates, including the upgrade from Unreal Engine 4 to 5, and newer changes preparing the game for multiplayer.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The current scope centers on bringing the starting zone (Act 1) to life, which includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player gear\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various world locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">World features such as a day &amp; night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey into the fantasy world of Epica, compete with other players from around the world for rank one on the ladder.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fantasy adventure &amp; exploration game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting &amp; trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global rankings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam achievements </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">State of Epica</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is accessible during Early Access, the core development stage. The game went through several major updates, including the upgrade from Unreal Engine 4 to 5, and newer changes preparing the game for multiplayer.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The current scope centers on bringing the starting zone (Act 1) to life, which includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player gear\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various world locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">World features such as a day &amp; night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
